{"id":27758,"slug":"l-atalante","title":"L’Atalante","year":1934,"country":"France","duration":89,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27758-l-atalante","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/357230c66272f37ef9bb89fed70af96d/hMaBKU4xZqKE4ziVhxCEZUEb7PnL2S_large.jpg","description":"In Jean Vigo’s hands, an unassuming tale of conjugal love becomes an achingly romantic reverie of desire and hope. Jean (Jean Dasté), a barge captain, marries Juliette (Dita Parlo), an innocent country girl, and the two climb aboard Jean’s boat, the L’Atalante—otherwise populated by an earthy first mate (Michel Simon) and a multitude of mangy cats—and embark on their new life together. Both a surprisingly erotic idyll and a clear-eyed meditation on love, L’Atalante, Vigo’s only feature-length work, is a film like no other.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Jean Vigo","slug":"jean-vigo"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jean Dasté","role":"Jean","slug":"jean-daste"},{"actor":"Dita Parlo","role":"Juliette","slug":"dita-parlo"},{"actor":"Michel Simon","role":"Père Jules","slug":"michel-simon"},{"actor":"Louis Lefebvre","role":"Kid","slug":"louis-lefebvre"},{"actor":"Gilles Margaritis","role":"Showman","slug":"gilles-margaritis"},{"actor":"Fanny Clar","role":"Juliette’s mother","slug":"fanny-clar"},{"actor":"Raphaël Diligent","role":"Raspoutine","slug":"raphael-diligent"},{"actor":"Maurice Gilles","role":"Manager of the Waterways Company","slug":"maurice-gilles"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Jean Vigo","slug":"jean-vigo"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Jean Vigo","slug":"jean-vigo"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Albert Riéra","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Maurice Jaubert","slug":null},{"role":"Photography","person":"Boris Kaufman","slug":"boris-kaufman"},{"role":"Photography","person":"Louis Berger","slug":"louis-berger"},{"role":"Photography","person":"Jean-Paul Alphen","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Louis Chavance","slug":nul